{"id": "mix1-en", "request": {"model": "spark-study", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Mix 180 grams of a 20%-by-mass salt solution with 120 grams of a 35%-by-mass salt solution. No mass is lost. What is the resulting salt percentage (give the percentage number, not a fraction of one)?\n\nShow a short calculation. End with exactly one line FINAL: <number>, in the unit requested. Use an integer, decimal, or fraction and no unit on that final line."}], "temperature": 0, "seed": 20260910, "max_tokens": 1536, "stream": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}, "cache_prompt": false}, "started_utc": "2026-09-09T16:47:17Z", "response": {"choices": [{"finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "Let the total mass be 180 + 120 = 300 grams.  \nSalt from first solution: 0.20 × 180 = 36 g  \nSalt from second solution: 0.35 × 120 = 42 g  \nTotal salt: 36 + 42 = 78 g  \nPercentage: (78 / 300) × 100 = 26%\n\nFINAL: 26"}}], "created": 1788972438, "model": "spark-study", "system_fingerprint": "b10828-3ad1ba733", "object": "chat.completion", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 116, "prompt_tokens": 113, "total_tokens": 229, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "id": "chatcmpl-08P3GZWhFWCxd7PJeqmQn4bjNgM5YLo7", "timings": {"cache_n": 0, "prompt_n": 113, "prompt_ms": 72.899, "prompt_per_token_ms": 0.6451238938053098, "prompt_per_second": 1550.0898503408825, "predicted_n": 116, "predicted_ms": 923.35, "predicted_per_token_ms": 8.029130434782608, "predicted_per_second": 124.54648833053555}}, "elapsed_seconds": 1.031}
{"id": "mix1-ko", "request": {"model": "spark-study", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "질량 기준 농도 20%인 소금물 180그램과 농도 35%인 소금물 120그램을 섞습니다. 질량 손실은 없습니다. 섞은 소금물의 농도는 몇 %인가요? (1에 대한 비율이 아니라 백분율의 숫자를 답하세요.)\n\n짧게 계산 과정을 쓰세요. 마지막에는 FINAL: <숫자> 형식의 줄을 정확히 한 번 쓰세요. 답은 문제에서 요구한 단위로 쓰고, 마지막 줄에는 정수·소수·분수만 쓰고 단위는 붙이지 마세요."}], "temperature": 0, "seed": 20260910, "max_tokens": 1536, "stream": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}, "cache_prompt": false}, "started_utc": "2026-09-09T16:47:18Z", "response": {"choices": [{"finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "먼저, 각 소금물의 소금 질량을 구합니다.\n\n- 20% 농도 소금물: 180g → 소금 질량 = \\(180 \\times 20\\% = 36\\)g  \n- 35% 농도 소금물: 120g → 소금 질량 = \\(120 \\times 35\\% = 42\\)g  \n\n총 소금 질량 = \\(36 + 42 = 78\\)g  \n\n총 질량 = \\(180 + 120 = 300\\)g  \n\n섞은 소금물의 농도 = \\(\\frac{78}{300} \\times 100\\% = 26\\%\\)\n\nFINAL: 26"}}], "created": 1788972440, "model": "spark-study", "system_fingerprint": "b10828-3ad1ba733", "object": "chat.completion", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 208, "prompt_tokens": 219, "total_tokens": 427, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "id": "chatcmpl-nGvASd5pLDYZ3YKFcUjbNWmUoSB6Qq3Y", "timings": {"cache_n": 0, "prompt_n": 219, "prompt_ms": 87.706, "prompt_per_token_ms": 0.4004840182648402, "prompt_per_second": 2496.978541946959, "predicted_n": 208, "predicted_ms": 1733.537, "predicted_per_token_ms": 8.374574879227053, "predicted_per_second": 119.4090463601296}}, "elapsed_seconds": 1.844}
{"id": "mix2-en", "request": {"model": "spark-study", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Mix 150 grams of a 12%-by-mass salt solution with 250 grams of a 28%-by-mass salt solution. No mass is lost. What is the resulting salt percentage (give the percentage number, not a fraction of one)?\n\nShow a short calculation. End with exactly one line FINAL: <number>, in the unit requested. Use an integer, decimal, or fraction and no unit on that final line."}], "temperature": 0, "seed": 20260910, "max_tokens": 1536, "stream": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}, "cache_prompt": false}, "started_utc": "2026-09-09T16:47:20Z", "response": {"choices": [{"finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "Let the total mass be 150 + 250 = 400 grams.  \nSalt mass from first solution: 150 × 0.12 = 18 g.  \nSalt mass from second solution: 250 × 0.28 = 70 g.  \nTotal salt mass = 18 + 70 = 88 g.  \nPercentage = (88 / 400) × 100 = 22%.\n\nFINAL: 22"}}], "created": 1788972441, "model": "spark-study", "system_fingerprint": "b10828-3ad1ba733", "object": "chat.completion", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 122, "prompt_tokens": 113, "total_tokens": 235, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "id": "chatcmpl-ktr6KgmffQArPfG1WE4Y9t22wOiDmlKN", "timings": {"cache_n": 0, "prompt_n": 113, "prompt_ms": 71.931, "prompt_per_token_ms": 0.6365575221238938, "prompt_per_second": 1570.9499381351575, "predicted_n": 122, "predicted_ms": 1014.321, "predicted_per_token_ms": 8.382818181818182, "predicted_per_second": 119.2916246434807}}, "elapsed_seconds": 1.11}
